OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FBen meets previous contributors
OL,7,     Fwho turned their back on the
OL,8,     Frat-race. In the wilds of
OL,9,     FQueensland he revisits the
OL,10,     Fever-resilient Bette, who, in her
OL,11,     F80s, lives alone.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen revisits his old friend Alex,
OL,14,     Fwho is living in the mountains of
OL,15,     Fcentral Portugal, discovering that
OL,16,     FAlex has followed through with his
OL,17,     Fdream of creating a retreat. (Ep2)
