OL,5,G0105 Autopsy
OL,6,     FGary Coleman rose to fame as the
OL,7,     Fstar of the eighties sitcom
OL,8,     FDiff'rent Strokes. Coleman passed
OL,9,     Faway under mysterious
OL,10,     Fcircumstances in 2010. Now, a
OL,11,     FForensic Pathologist investigates.
OL,12,     F(Ep3)
OL,13,G0205 Autopsy
OL,14,     FSteve Jobs passed away from a rare
OL,15,     Fand easily treatable form of
OL,16,     Fpancreatic cancer. Dr. Michael
OL,17,     FHunter studies Jobs' medical
OL,18,     Frecords to uncover the reasons
OL,19,     Fbehind his untimely death. (Ep4)
